ocol—and why WAF rule patches fail to protect modern React and Next.js apps.","contents":"<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65a4638e376d11af3056eaeb/6977d4b09e62a4db634f8289_React2Shell%20(CVE-2025-55182)%20DeepDive.png\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65a4638e376d11af3056eaeb/6977d4b09e62a4db634f8289_React2Shell%20(CVE-2025-55182)%20DeepDive-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65a4638e376d11af3056eaeb/6977d4b09e62a4db634f8289_React2Shell%20(CVE-2025-55182)%20DeepDive-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65a4638e376d11af3056eaeb/6977d4b09e62a4db634f8289_React2Shell%20(CVE-2025-55182)%20DeepDive-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65a4638e376d11af3056eaeb/6977d4b09e62a4db634f8289_React2Shell%20(CVE-2025-55182)%20DeepDive.png 1200w\" class=\"blog-card-image\"><div class=\"blog-card-content\"><div class=\"vertical-gap-24px\"><div fs-cmsfilter-field=\"category\" style=\"color:#28d8d8;border-color:#28d8d8\" class=\"blog-tag\">Security</div><div class=\"vertical-gap-8px\"><div fs-cmsfilter-field=\"description\" class=\"lines-3-text\">A deep analysis of React2Shell (CVE-2025-55182) RCE in RSC Flight protocol—and why WAF rule patches fail to protect modern React and Next.js apps.</div></div></div><div class=\"learn-more-link\"><div>Read more</div><div class=\"w-embed\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M9.00847 3.89997L2.35425 10.5534L3.44731 11.6465L10.1008 4.9938V10.8572H11.6468V2.35391H3.14351V3.89997H9.00847Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n</svg></div></div></div>","retrieved":1780117526897},{"title":"Learn why true reachability means detecting executed vulnerable code, not just used libraries, and how this shift cuts SCA noise by 97%.","contents":"<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/65a4638e376d11af3056eaeb/6977d4c0ac7192a8630ae8ce_Reachab